WEBVTT

00:00.584 --> 00:01.710
[wooden swords clacking]

00:05.965 --> 00:07.215
[sighs]

00:07.591 --> 00:09.259
Not bad.

00:09.301 --> 00:11.428
I see that your swordsmanship
has come a long way.

00:11.470 --> 00:13.848
You're not the sweet kid
you once were, huh?

00:15.307 --> 00:18.059
I trained extensively in hopes
of becoming a knight one day.

00:18.101 --> 00:19.687
Even more so to become like you!

00:19.728 --> 00:22.397
Guess I should be honored
to hear such flattering words!

00:22.439 --> 00:25.359
It's incredible.
She's managing rather well.

00:25.400 --> 00:27.152
I'm surprised
she's strong enough

00:27.194 --> 00:29.196
to stand against
the legendary knight.

00:29.237 --> 00:30.531
Don't be so sure.

00:30.572 --> 00:32.700
Remember,
they're only training now.

00:32.741 --> 00:34.618
Besides, Lady Wistaresia
has been fighting

00:34.660 --> 00:35.995
with one sword.

00:36.035 --> 00:37.329
She prefers two.

00:37.371 --> 00:38.914
It looks like I have no reason

00:38.956 --> 00:40.916
to hold back
against you any longer.

00:40.958 --> 00:43.502
Very well, give me
your absolute best!

00:44.043 --> 00:46.755
[dramatic music playing]

00:52.636 --> 00:54.680
[grunting]

00:58.642 --> 00:59.768
Oh, wow.

01:02.479 --> 01:03.689
[grunts]

01:07.192 --> 01:08.652
You're very skilled, Resia!

01:09.194 --> 01:11.279
And you truly live up
to your reputation!

01:11.655 --> 01:14.033
Every move I make,
you're prepared for it.

01:14.073 --> 01:15.492
Have you been studying me?

01:15.910 --> 01:17.327
In that case.

01:18.495 --> 01:20.455
[shouts]

01:21.456 --> 01:23.417
[groans]

01:25.627 --> 01:27.170
You're a fine knight, Sera.

01:27.379 --> 01:28.589
And.

01:29.048 --> 01:31.174
If you weren't holding back
out of admiration,

01:31.550 --> 01:33.677
you might have come out
of this victorious.

01:34.469 --> 01:36.430
Is that why you resorted
to blinding me?

01:37.222 --> 01:39.058
Out of fear of me defeating you?

01:39.098 --> 01:41.226
You have to stop
thinking like a knight.

01:41.268 --> 01:43.562
We've got fire-breathing dragons
in these parts.

01:43.604 --> 01:45.230
So if you're getting all
worked up

01:45.272 --> 01:46.941
over a little bit of dirt,

01:46.982 --> 01:49.150
then you're gonna wind up dead
sooner than you think.

01:49.192 --> 01:51.194
The willingness
to do what it takes

01:51.236 --> 01:54.031
while maintaining such refined
yet forceful willpower,

01:54.073 --> 01:56.283
I see who she is
at her core remains unchanged.

01:56.324 --> 01:57.785
[WYSTERESIA laughs]

01:57.826 --> 01:59.536
[SERAFINA] She's still
direct and brilliant.

02:00.203 --> 02:01.538
Come to think of it.

02:02.163 --> 02:04.583
[SERAFINA] She once disguised
herself as a village girl

02:04.625 --> 02:07.086
and intentionally
got herself kidnapped.

02:08.336 --> 02:09.671
[BANDITS chuckling]

02:11.298 --> 02:12.466
[WYSTERESIA smirks]

02:18.013 --> 02:19.974
[SERAFINA] All to destroy
a bandit hideout.

02:21.140 --> 02:23.435
She never shied
from using free-wheeling tactics

02:23.477 --> 02:25.062
unbecoming of a knight.

02:25.104 --> 02:27.314
[laughs]

02:28.523 --> 02:31.568
And that gave rise to the many
legends we know today.

02:33.320 --> 02:34.989
You're absolutely right, Resia.

02:35.447 --> 02:36.740
I'll keep that in mind.

02:39.952 --> 02:41.369
Well, that's no good.

02:41.411 --> 02:43.622
It looks like
I must've gotten a little dirt

02:43.664 --> 02:45.248
on your engagement necklace.

02:45.290 --> 02:46.875
Oh yeah, while we were fighting?

02:46.917 --> 02:47.668
Yeah.

02:48.376 --> 02:49.670
Wash it off later, all right?

02:50.587 --> 02:53.465
Sure, but how?
It can't be removed, can it?

02:53.507 --> 02:55.174
[WYSTERESIA] Of course it can.

02:55.216 --> 02:56.969
Huh?

02:57.011 --> 02:58.720
Whatever gave you the idea
that it couldn't come off?

02:59.304 --> 03:00.555
I don't see a latch anywhere.

03:01.222 --> 03:03.017
Veor didn't tell you, did he?

03:03.058 --> 03:05.019
[WYSTERESIA]
If you will it to come off,

03:05.060 --> 03:06.103
it will do so.

03:07.062 --> 03:09.397
You're saying
I can wish it removed?

03:09.439 --> 03:12.275
Yes, it reacts to the willpower
of the one who wears it.

03:12.317 --> 03:15.070
Try grabbing hold of it
while wishing for it to come off

03:15.112 --> 03:16.279
and you'll see.

03:16.321 --> 03:17.990
Um, sure.

03:18.949 --> 03:20.241
[unsure]

03:20.575 --> 03:22.119
Come off!

03:24.371 --> 03:25.580
[gasps]

03:26.498 --> 03:28.458
This is amazing!

03:28.500 --> 03:30.627
The necklaces
are enchanted, as well?

03:31.210 --> 03:32.504
Why so surprised?

03:32.546 --> 03:34.339
Weapon enchantments
react to the will

03:34.381 --> 03:35.674
to defend or attack.

03:36.257 --> 03:38.635
So a necklace that comes undone
when you desire it to

03:38.677 --> 03:40.387
shouldn't really be so strange.

03:41.763 --> 03:44.349
In fact, if you didn't want
the necklace to begin with,

03:44.391 --> 03:46.518
it would have come
right off when you got it.

03:46.560 --> 03:48.311
Oh, I see.

03:49.980 --> 03:52.107
I don't think
she does see, though.

03:52.149 --> 03:53.650
I mean,
if she's still got it on,

03:53.692 --> 03:55.069
what does that imply?

03:55.485 --> 03:56.570
[amused]

03:56.611 --> 03:57.779
Huh?

03:59.531 --> 04:02.534
[peaceful music playing]

04:04.203 --> 04:05.370
And good as new.

04:06.329 --> 04:08.331
[SERAFINA]
have an engagement necklace.

04:08.999 --> 04:10.375
Wait, stop!

04:10.417 --> 04:11.960
How can I even consider this

04:12.002 --> 04:13.795
when I have yet
to fulfill my duty?

04:13.837 --> 04:15.005
[stressed]

04:15.047 --> 04:16.255
Attach!

04:17.549 --> 04:19.258
Do you hear me? Attach!

04:19.300 --> 04:20.594
Attach! Attach!

04:21.136 --> 04:23.262
Why are you refusing to attach?

04:25.015 --> 04:26.558
What's going on here?

04:27.184 --> 04:29.186
[SERAFINA] Why isn't it working?

04:34.315 --> 04:37.402
[♪ upbeat music playing,
Mayu Maeshima "Beautiful"]

04:46.120 --> 04:52.042
THE WARRIOR PRINCESS
AND THE BARBARIC KING

06:00.194 --> 06:02.529
[WYSTERESIA] You can't put
the necklace back on?

06:02.821 --> 06:03.947
[SERAFINA] Indeed.

06:03.989 --> 06:05.573
It refuses to encircle my neck.

06:06.407 --> 06:08.451
Even though I'm strongly
wishing for it.

06:09.328 --> 06:11.205
Do you know
why this is happening?

06:11.454 --> 06:13.540
Well, let me think.

06:15.374 --> 06:17.585
Oh, you didn't perform
the ritual, did you?

06:17.627 --> 06:19.296
The first thing
you need to do is

06:19.338 --> 06:21.464
sneak up on the person
who gave it to you.

06:21.506 --> 06:24.425
Then cleanse them with water,
and after they're drenched,

06:26.220 --> 06:29.056
Go like this and say,
"Hey, guess who?"

06:29.931 --> 06:31.933
Whisper right
in their ear, okay?

06:31.975 --> 06:33.143
But why?

06:33.185 --> 06:34.269
Just give it a shot.

06:34.311 --> 06:35.979
Oh, um. Right.

06:36.021 --> 06:37.522
Hey, guess who?

06:38.232 --> 06:40.150
[WYSTERESIA]
Again, but more erotic.

06:40.483 --> 06:42.069
[SERAFINA] All right, I'll try.

06:42.319 --> 06:44.403
Hey, guess who?

06:45.072 --> 06:47.532
Come on now!
You have to feel it.

06:47.574 --> 06:49.368
Really project your sexy side.

06:49.408 --> 06:51.245
I've never had to use it before.

06:53.705 --> 06:55.874
Fine. How's this?

06:56.415 --> 06:58.335
[deep voice]
Hey, can you guess who?

06:58.626 --> 07:00.837
We're getting somewhere.

07:00.879 --> 07:02.172
And when you say it,

07:02.214 --> 07:03.882
add some notes
of purity to your tone,

07:03.924 --> 07:05.508
and open-mindedness,
and strength

07:05.550 --> 07:07.928
that calls to mind
the harshness of the East!

07:07.969 --> 07:08.803
Makes sense?

07:08.845 --> 07:10.638
Um, not exactly, no.

07:10.680 --> 07:13.267
When he calls your name,
it'll be a nice little setup

07:13.308 --> 07:15.518
for whatever you two
want to do next.

07:15.560 --> 07:17.938
[SERAFINA] So proceeding
with this foolishness is

07:17.979 --> 07:20.357
supposed to let me
re-attach the necklace?

07:20.982 --> 07:22.859
Sure, rituals are
like that, you know.

07:22.901 --> 07:24.485
The more primitive,
the more potent.

07:24.527 --> 07:26.445
Ugh, I never
should have removed it.

07:26.487 --> 07:27.739
[gasps]

07:27.781 --> 07:30.200
Wait. I have to do
all that to Veor?

07:30.242 --> 07:31.368
Even the voice?

07:31.410 --> 07:32.619
That's correct.

07:32.660 --> 07:34.913
So kid, can you pull it off?

07:35.454 --> 07:38.375
Maybe. Well. I think.

07:41.044 --> 07:42.337
I can do it!

07:42.379 --> 07:43.588
Yeah, you can!

07:43.964 --> 07:45.506
But you have to make sure

07:45.548 --> 07:48.093
you keep the engagement necklace
coming off a secret.

07:48.135 --> 07:49.677
So don't let Veor see you.

07:50.304 --> 07:52.389
That will prove to be
a much bigger challenge.

07:55.558 --> 07:56.726
Malcius.

07:58.228 --> 07:59.478
Oh, hi.

08:00.355 --> 08:01.606
[CERSEI] Tell me, ma'am,

08:01.648 --> 08:03.442
why'd you give her
those instructions?

08:03.984 --> 08:06.027
We both know
that nothing you said to do

08:06.069 --> 08:08.529
is even necessary for her
to get the necklace back on.

08:09.281 --> 08:11.241
I never said it would
let her put it back on,

08:11.283 --> 08:13.034
only that it would be
a nice setup.

08:13.076 --> 08:14.286
And it will!

08:14.328 --> 08:16.455
We're talking
about Veor and Sera here.

08:16.495 --> 08:18.457
It's just a little push,
that's all.

08:18.497 --> 08:21.084
Otherwise, I'll be an old woman
when they marry.

08:21.126 --> 08:23.044
I'd say you're meddling
in their affairs.

08:24.338 --> 08:26.965
When my grandchild's born,
I want them to see me like this.

08:27.007 --> 08:28.383
I won't be pretty forever.

08:28.425 --> 08:29.508
[sighs]

08:29.968 --> 08:31.719
You're getting ahead
of yourself.

08:40.937 --> 08:43.064
First, I have to
sneak up behind him.

08:43.606 --> 08:45.733
And then I need
to douse him with this water.

08:46.067 --> 08:47.526
Right. Here goes!

08:48.403 --> 08:50.280
Thanks for carrying
the firewood.

08:50.322 --> 08:51.614
It was so darn heavy.

08:52.115 --> 08:53.950
Of course. Happy to help.

08:53.992 --> 08:55.285
It's no trouble at all.

08:55.327 --> 08:56.411
[GATAR] Mom, up!

08:56.744 --> 08:58.705
Hey, honey.
Why do you want to go up?

09:07.506 --> 09:09.174
Wait. What's that for?

09:09.216 --> 09:10.884
I hope you'll forgive me, Veor!

09:10.925 --> 09:13.178
But I must apologize
at a later time.

09:13.803 --> 09:16.473
I suppose the best time to do it
would be when he's alone.

09:17.432 --> 09:18.975
That was very odd of her.

09:19.017 --> 09:20.310
Why would she do that?

09:21.520 --> 09:24.022
I am just
as confused as you are.

09:25.857 --> 09:29.027
But she wouldn't do that
without reason.

09:29.069 --> 09:30.653
I only wonder what it could be.

09:31.696 --> 09:33.407
[CERSEI] Master Veor's schedule?

09:33.448 --> 09:36.368
Yes. I thought it best
to target my quarry

09:36.410 --> 09:37.994
when he's without company.

09:38.370 --> 09:40.038
So now he's your quarry?

09:40.080 --> 09:42.957
You're taking this far more
seriously than I imagined.

09:42.999 --> 09:44.459
It's a knight's duty.

09:44.501 --> 09:45.835
Once we begin something,

09:45.877 --> 09:47.795
then we must see it
through to the end.

09:47.837 --> 09:49.130
Nobles.

09:49.588 --> 09:51.966
You have no clue
just how much of a pain you are.

09:52.008 --> 09:54.010
Veor's tasks for the day,
where he's going,

09:54.052 --> 09:55.303
anything you know!

09:55.345 --> 09:57.097
Please help me, I'm begging you.

09:58.639 --> 10:01.017
Hey, Mother. Where is Sera?

10:01.059 --> 10:03.395
[WYSTERESIA] Oh, she had to
step out for something.

10:03.437 --> 10:04.563
I see.

10:05.063 --> 10:06.189
Before you run off.

10:06.231 --> 10:07.648
I want to know.

10:07.690 --> 10:09.568
How is it going with you two?

10:09.943 --> 10:11.111
[VEOR unsure]

10:11.152 --> 10:13.071
Sit. Let's have a quick chat.

10:13.530 --> 10:15.282
All right, son.

10:15.323 --> 10:17.117
If you truly care about a woman,

10:17.158 --> 10:19.286
then you must prove it
to her somehow.

10:20.078 --> 10:21.246
How do I do that?

10:21.288 --> 10:23.415
[WYSTERESIA]
The best way is with a gift.

10:23.457 --> 10:25.166
Just think of it as an offering.

10:25.208 --> 10:27.335
It's a symbol of the love
you have for her.

10:28.420 --> 10:30.422
Right, this is still
unfamiliar to me.

10:30.713 --> 10:32.215
So I could use your help.

10:32.257 --> 10:33.592
What's a good gift?

10:33.632 --> 10:35.343
[WYSTERESIA]
Use that damn head of yours.

10:35.385 --> 10:37.220
Well, that's what
I'd normally say.

10:37.262 --> 10:40.223
But since you asked nicely,

10:40.265 --> 10:42.183
why not make
something unusual to eat?

10:42.225 --> 10:43.893
Such as?

10:43.935 --> 10:46.062
Gather some uncommon ingredients
and make a tasty dish.

10:46.104 --> 10:48.315
One that shows
you put real effort into it.

10:49.023 --> 10:50.609
[VEOR]
More mundane than I thought.

10:51.359 --> 10:53.027
I'm going to check
on the saplings.

10:53.694 --> 10:55.614
Oh! Well when the time comes,

10:55.654 --> 10:57.907
be sure to do it
somewhere that's secluded.

10:57.949 --> 10:59.951
Somewhere where you
and her can knock boots

10:59.993 --> 11:01.035
without anyone hearing!

11:01.077 --> 11:02.370
What?

11:02.412 --> 11:03.662
There will be
no "boot knocking!"

11:04.914 --> 11:06.166
[sighs]

11:06.583 --> 11:09.169
Fine. Earlier, Master Veor said
that he was going out

11:09.210 --> 11:10.711
to check on the saplings.

11:10.753 --> 11:13.047
Isn't that where the great
cleansing was performed?

11:13.089 --> 11:14.341
An ideal spot to shadow Veor

11:14.382 --> 11:16.343
while remaining
hidden from his sight.

11:16.384 --> 11:18.303
That is where I will
sneak up behind

11:18.345 --> 11:20.013
and then "guess who" him!

11:20.054 --> 11:22.265
This may be silly to ask,
but try not to be a nuisance?

11:22.723 --> 11:25.185
[SERAFINA] Don't have to worry!
I'll apologize later!

11:25.226 --> 11:26.478
Well, I am worried

11:26.520 --> 11:28.605
because you're completely
missing the point!

11:29.105 --> 11:30.231
I don't understand

11:30.273 --> 11:32.025
how I wound up
with laundry duty!

11:32.066 --> 11:33.109
[SERAFINA] Malcius.

11:34.027 --> 11:37.280
I am taking
to the field of battle.

11:37.322 --> 11:38.532
So, wish me luck.

11:38.948 --> 11:40.450
Uh, good luck.

11:40.492 --> 11:42.536
[VEOR] Make something
unusual to eat.

11:42.577 --> 11:44.287
Oh!

11:44.329 --> 11:46.373
The saplings have taken
to the ground well enough.

11:46.414 --> 11:48.416
To see the greenery
restored to the land

11:48.458 --> 11:49.584
that was so near death.

11:49.626 --> 11:51.085
It's a wondrous sight.

11:52.170 --> 11:53.421
Sorry, Veor!

11:53.463 --> 11:54.713
Forgive me!

11:56.341 --> 11:57.758
[nervous]

11:57.800 --> 11:59.594
I emitted the slightest surge
of willpower

11:59.636 --> 12:01.054
and he reacted to it.

12:01.095 --> 12:02.347
Hi?

12:02.972 --> 12:04.224
[sighs]

12:05.642 --> 12:07.185
What are you doing up there?

12:07.227 --> 12:08.395
Stay back!

12:08.978 --> 12:10.689
I'm begging you,
don't come any closer!

12:11.606 --> 12:12.940
I'll explain everything.

12:12.982 --> 12:15.151
But first, I have to
complete the ritual.

12:15.193 --> 12:16.236
Please!

12:16.403 --> 12:17.654
Wait!

12:18.488 --> 12:20.615
[ethereal music]

12:21.282 --> 12:22.576
What ritual?

12:23.201 --> 12:25.161
[SERAFINA catches breath]

12:25.412 --> 12:27.247
Douse him with water, huh?

12:27.288 --> 12:29.499
How can such a simple task
be so difficult?

12:30.041 --> 12:31.292
All right.

12:33.002 --> 12:34.753
Perhaps.

12:34.795 --> 12:37.006
[SERAFINA] An offensive approach
will be more effective!

12:38.049 --> 12:41.678
[playful music]

12:50.103 --> 12:51.438
[yawns]

12:53.607 --> 12:56.359
[music continues]

13:12.250 --> 13:13.627
[hissing]

13:22.969 --> 13:24.638
[VEOR] It's somewhat clever.

13:24.679 --> 13:27.557
But I'm not sure the hat
will help you in this "ritual."

13:34.314 --> 13:37.150
No matter my tactics,
he notices me every time!

13:37.191 --> 13:39.611
The man has senses
like a wild animal!

13:40.069 --> 13:41.988
How will I ever sneak up
behind someone

13:42.029 --> 13:44.365
who doesn't possess
a blind spot?

13:44.407 --> 13:46.200
She has been
awfully weird today.

13:46.242 --> 13:48.077
I wonder what could be
troubling her.

13:48.119 --> 13:50.204
[CERSEI] ♪ But don't let it
Get you down ♪

13:50.246 --> 13:52.957
♪ Because it's fine
The second time around ♪

13:52.999 --> 13:54.626
♪ La-la la-la la-la ♪

13:55.418 --> 13:56.795
What do I do now?

13:57.128 --> 13:58.296
No, stop!

13:58.588 --> 14:00.381
I told Resia
that I can pull this off.

14:00.423 --> 14:02.049
So giving up isn't an option!

14:03.217 --> 14:05.595
But, I would still
do it regardless!

14:06.137 --> 14:08.181
I am a knight
with a task at hand.

14:08.222 --> 14:10.433
Therefore, I will see it
through to the end.

14:10.475 --> 14:12.059
It's not unlike taking an oath!

14:12.101 --> 14:14.061
[SERAFINA]
I'll complete this ritual!

14:15.104 --> 14:16.147
Hold on.

14:17.106 --> 14:19.442
One of Resia's legends
may hold the key!

14:25.365 --> 14:26.741
It had gotten a bit long.

14:27.908 --> 14:29.744
So, how were the saplings,
Master Veor?

14:29.994 --> 14:31.412
Good.

14:31.454 --> 14:33.289
They seem to be developing
quite nicely,

14:33.331 --> 14:35.082
but while I was
checking on them,

14:35.124 --> 14:36.543
something rather odd happened.

14:36.584 --> 14:38.085
Care to tell me what it was?

14:38.127 --> 14:39.420
[VEOR] Well, Sera was there,

14:39.462 --> 14:41.464
and she was acting
very strangely.

14:42.465 --> 14:44.300
It's like she has
some sort of business

14:44.342 --> 14:45.510
involving me.

14:45.552 --> 14:47.094
But she ends up running off

14:47.136 --> 14:48.555
whenever I try to talk to her.

14:48.596 --> 14:50.014
[CERSEI gasps]

14:50.223 --> 14:51.349
Cersei?

14:51.725 --> 14:53.601
Just be sure
to keep the fake ritual

14:53.643 --> 14:55.102
a secret from Veor,

14:55.144 --> 14:56.354
you got it?

14:56.396 --> 14:57.731
[sighs]

14:58.398 --> 15:00.024
What could I have done?

15:00.066 --> 15:03.069
Perhaps I've inadvertently
insulted Sera and upset her.

15:03.110 --> 15:04.571
No.

15:04.612 --> 15:06.447
I don't think that's the case,
Master Veor!

15:06.489 --> 15:08.282
In fact, she.

15:08.324 --> 15:10.368
Anything in particular
come to mind?

15:10.410 --> 15:12.495
Well, there is one thing.

15:13.872 --> 15:15.582
[VEOR]
It's her engagement necklace.

15:16.123 --> 15:19.252
[gentle piano music]

15:21.045 --> 15:23.590
She was fast asleep
when she was brought here,

15:23.631 --> 15:26.551
and I thought that would be
the best time to put it on her.

15:27.468 --> 15:29.970
I had intended to reveal
what it represented myself.

15:30.012 --> 15:32.181
But in the end,
Mother was the first

15:32.223 --> 15:33.683
to explain its purpose.

15:34.684 --> 15:37.061
I may have been afraid
of being rejected.

15:37.395 --> 15:39.355
So in a way, it was a relief.

15:41.315 --> 15:43.651
Simply seeing her
wearing the necklace every day

15:43.693 --> 15:45.403
was enough to make me happy.

15:45.445 --> 15:47.572
Therefore, I chose
to push the issue aside,

15:47.614 --> 15:49.031
instead of addressing it.

15:49.948 --> 15:51.409
This is all news to me.

15:52.159 --> 15:54.537
[VEOR] Maybe Sera is upset
that I showed such cowardice,

15:54.579 --> 15:56.955
and finds me
to be pitiful because of it.

15:57.290 --> 15:58.666
What else could it be?

15:59.918 --> 16:01.210
I'm not so sure.

16:01.252 --> 16:03.504
I don't think she would
be disappointed in you

16:03.546 --> 16:05.005
about something like that.

16:05.715 --> 16:08.384
[CERSEI] Not when you've been
trying so hard to win her over.

16:09.051 --> 16:10.595
I hope you're right, Cersei.

16:11.178 --> 16:12.722
[CERSEI]
You don't have to worry.

16:14.181 --> 16:15.349
[smiles]

16:18.394 --> 16:20.313
[VEOR] I should go
face her again.

16:20.979 --> 16:22.398
And, tell her everything.

16:23.190 --> 16:25.443
The time's come for me
to confess my true feelings.

16:26.527 --> 16:28.947
[SERAFINA] I apologize,
but this is urgent!

16:28.987 --> 16:31.491
For me to succeed,
I need your cooperation.

16:31.532 --> 16:33.952
Are you willing to aid
your fellow countrywoman?

16:33.992 --> 16:35.161
Please!

16:35.202 --> 16:36.454
Just tell me
what you want of me!

16:37.079 --> 16:39.415
It is something
that I can only ask you to do.

16:39.457 --> 16:41.709
However,
this brilliant plan is rooted

16:41.751 --> 16:43.586
in the legends of Resia herself!

16:44.170 --> 16:46.088
So I'm certain
that it will succeed!

16:46.380 --> 16:47.924
A plan?

16:48.424 --> 16:50.384
[gasps] Is that it?

16:50.426 --> 16:53.387
Could Lady Serafina be fed up
with these barbarians?

16:53.429 --> 16:56.098
She's come to her senses
and wants to escape with me!

16:56.140 --> 16:57.266
[laughs]

16:57.976 --> 16:59.978
Yes, anything! I'll do it!

17:00.018 --> 17:01.270
Do you mean that?

17:01.312 --> 17:02.563
Thank you so much!

17:03.021 --> 17:04.273
All right then.

17:06.317 --> 17:07.944
[shouting]

17:09.153 --> 17:11.614
[MALCIUS] Well, I didn't
exactly mean anything!

17:15.409 --> 17:16.661
What's this?

17:17.411 --> 17:18.997
Where's she going?

17:20.957 --> 17:23.960
Wait, Sera!
I need to talk to you!

17:24.126 --> 17:25.336
[VEOR] Stop!

17:27.421 --> 17:28.673
Sera.

17:30.090 --> 17:31.342
[surprised]

17:33.302 --> 17:35.137
Come on. Not again!

17:35.179 --> 17:36.723
I have you now!

17:39.308 --> 17:40.518
[gasps]

17:41.644 --> 17:44.522
[SERAFINA] Egads!
Damn you, Veor.

17:44.564 --> 17:47.191
Who knew you had a weapon
like this up your sleeve?

17:47.233 --> 17:49.193
I should've expected this
from the man

17:49.235 --> 17:50.820
who can fight me
to a standstill!

17:50.862 --> 17:51.738
And yet-—

17:53.865 --> 17:57.577
I won't be beaten!

18:01.121 --> 18:03.081
Hey. Guess who?

18:03.290 --> 18:04.542
Huh?

18:04.959 --> 18:06.126
[VEOR] That voice.

18:06.168 --> 18:07.962
Such a delicate
yet vibrant sound

18:08.004 --> 18:09.923
can only belong to one woman.

18:10.297 --> 18:11.549
What is this?

18:11.591 --> 18:13.968
Am I being tested
in some weird fashion?

18:14.301 --> 18:15.762
Answer me.

18:15.803 --> 18:16.971
Say my name.

18:17.680 --> 18:20.224
You are none other than Sera.

18:21.099 --> 18:24.353
Serafina de Lavillant. Right?

18:28.066 --> 18:29.275
So it is you.

18:29.525 --> 18:31.736
Re-attach! Now!

18:39.159 --> 18:40.995
But I did it!

18:41.454 --> 18:44.164
Sera. Tell me, what's going on?

18:44.373 --> 18:46.166
I was trying to, uh,

18:46.208 --> 18:48.962
Resia told me
about a ritual I must perform.

18:49.712 --> 18:52.548
Since I took the necklace off,
and I couldn't.

18:53.925 --> 18:55.301
My mother, huh?

18:57.261 --> 19:00.098
[VEOR] Whatever she said
was obviously nonsense.

19:00.514 --> 19:01.849
Huh?

19:02.100 --> 19:04.142
[SERAFINA screams]

19:06.604 --> 19:09.690
[peaceful music playing]

19:13.444 --> 19:15.029
Really, Mother?

19:15.071 --> 19:17.490
In the future, can you refrain
from teasing her?

19:18.699 --> 19:21.035
I may have given Sera
a helpful suggestion or two,

19:21.077 --> 19:23.287
but not an untrue word
was spoken.

19:23.329 --> 19:25.581
You two needed an extra push.

19:25.623 --> 19:26.916
[annoyed]

19:27.374 --> 19:29.376
Pardon my mother
and her meddling.

19:29.418 --> 19:30.670
It's fine.

19:30.711 --> 19:32.296
Actually, I should've remembered

19:32.338 --> 19:34.172
how capricious she can be.

19:34.214 --> 19:36.050
So, the fault lies with me, too.

19:36.092 --> 19:37.426
All right!

19:37.468 --> 19:39.095
Now that everyone's apologized,

19:39.137 --> 19:41.347
let's eat this grub
Cersei made for us!

19:41.388 --> 19:42.598
[SERAFINA and VEOR sigh]

19:42.640 --> 19:44.558
I believe that
Sarah's perception of you

19:44.600 --> 19:46.853
as a heroic princess
who met a tragic end

19:47.185 --> 19:49.187
overshadowed
your authentic self.

19:49.647 --> 19:51.273
There may be truth to that.

19:52.274 --> 19:54.192
You deserve an apology, as well.

19:54.568 --> 19:56.487
I've made
a total nuisance of myself.

19:56.529 --> 19:58.072
Can you forgive me?

19:59.573 --> 20:02.200
Sera, you needn't apologize.

20:02.451 --> 20:04.202
If I could have just.

20:06.164 --> 20:10.001
Uh, would you join me
outside for a moment?

20:10.043 --> 20:11.209
Huh?

20:11.251 --> 20:12.378
Something wrong?

20:13.129 --> 20:14.421
Sure.

20:20.553 --> 20:22.346
[SERAFINA] So, what is it?

20:25.307 --> 20:27.560
[VEOR] Could you hand me
the engagement necklace?

20:27.601 --> 20:28.602
Huh?

20:28.644 --> 20:30.604
Oh. Here.

20:31.939 --> 20:35.651
There is no ritual required,
only an oath to be recited.

20:36.360 --> 20:37.778
What kind of oath?

20:38.362 --> 20:39.572
Serafina.

20:40.156 --> 20:42.200
Once again, I'd like
to give you this necklace

20:42.240 --> 20:44.160
as a symbol of my devotion.

20:47.038 --> 20:48.164
That all right?

20:48.330 --> 20:49.916
Oh yes, of course.

20:49.957 --> 20:52.752
I mean, I'm not against it
or anything.

20:53.002 --> 20:54.336
And.

20:54.670 --> 20:56.589
I feel quite anxious without it.

20:56.964 --> 20:58.340
Honestly, Sera.

20:58.841 --> 21:02.260
To hear you'll accept it
once more makes me so happy.

21:03.637 --> 21:05.223
Thundering maelstrom

21:05.263 --> 21:07.391
who lies betwixt earth
and stormclouds.

21:07.433 --> 21:09.351
The divine dragon.

21:09.393 --> 21:10.770
Whose will is law.

21:11.229 --> 21:12.563
Armor of rulers.

21:13.022 --> 21:14.107
Orkfiem.

21:14.648 --> 21:17.777
[gentle piano music]

21:25.118 --> 21:27.954
[VEOR] I ask that you bestow
your blessing upon us.

21:27.995 --> 21:31.207
As I, Veor,
hereby forge this bond.

21:31.249 --> 21:33.333
Invoking thy glorious name.

21:33.375 --> 21:37.463
I humbly welcome you
to unite this maiden and myself.

21:40.007 --> 21:42.260
For as long as she holds me
in her heart,

21:42.300 --> 21:45.012
or until such a time
as my life ends,

21:45.054 --> 21:47.556
allow our fates
to be intertwined

21:47.598 --> 21:49.809
and our futures to be as one.

21:51.602 --> 21:53.062
[sighs]

21:54.605 --> 21:56.149
It's done.

21:56.190 --> 21:58.234
Now that the prayer pact
has been recited,

21:58.276 --> 22:00.111
the necklace is back
where it belongs.

22:01.028 --> 22:03.072
I wanted to show you
how I truly feel.

22:03.489 --> 22:04.949
[VEOR] I hope I succeeded.

22:04.991 --> 22:05.992
[nervous]

22:06.617 --> 22:09.287
[SERAFINA] I think I get it!

22:10.997 --> 22:14.083
[♪ upbeat music playing,
Sajou no Hana "Shirubeki Koto"]

22:16.294 --> 22:17.544
Been gone a while.

22:17.586 --> 22:19.046
I wonder how he's doing.

22:19.463 --> 22:21.381
Though it makes
no difference to me.

22:22.091 --> 22:24.384
What are we to do
with the priest woman?

22:25.594 --> 22:28.472
Lady Serafina.
Please, come back!

22:30.348 --> 22:32.185
She appears to be distraught.

22:32.226 --> 22:34.436
Perhaps I should try
patting her on the head.

22:34.478 --> 22:36.189
Well, if you ask me,

22:36.230 --> 22:38.356
I don't believe she's worth
sullying your hands over.

22:40.442 --> 22:41.777
[pleased]

22:44.155 --> 22:46.364
[WYSTERESIA] I think
they're making progress.

22:47.074 --> 22:50.619
[MALCIUS wails]
